    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Downey McCarthy are delighted to launch to the market this most spacious and conveniently located five bedroom three storey property, which benefits from its superb position close to Cork city centre, UCC and all local amenities. The property requires renovation and modernisation throughout but it does offer tremendous potential to create a comfortable family home or a lucrative investment property.  \r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of reception hallway, living room, dining room, rear hall/ kitchenette and one w.c/shower room on the ground floor. At first floor level there are three bedrooms, a storage press and a hall/landing. On the second floor the property offers two additional bedrooms into the attic."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "This property fronts onto Blarney Street.\r\n\r\nThe rear of the property has a small courtyard."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Hallway - 5.28m x 1.91m \r\nA teak door with frosted glass panelling allows access into the reception hallway. The hallway has a mixture of tile and carpet flooring, and access to the electrical board.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.18m x 3.77m \r\nThe main living room has one window overlooking the front of the property, space for a suite of furniture, one centre light fitting, two wall-mounted light fittings and carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.19m x 3.06m \r\nThe dining room has one window overlooking the rear, two wall-mounted light fittings, one centre light fitting and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchenette/Rear Hallway - 3.28m x 2.92m \r\nThe kitchenette has one frosted window overlooking the rear, a stainless steel sink and vinyl flooring. A door allows access to a small courtyard.\r\n\r\nW.C & Shower - 1.37m x 1.24m \r\nAnother door allows access into the w.c, and there is a shower room which has tiling on the walls and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor Stairs and Landing - 2.53m x 1.88m \r\nThe first floor landing has one window overlooking the rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.48m x 3.1m \r\nThis double bedroom has one window to the rear, one wall-mounted light fitting and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nHall - 0.85m x 1.59m \r\nThere is access to a large storage press here.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.45m x 3.57m \r\nAnother double bedroom has one window overlooking the front of the property, one wall-mounted light fitting and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.62m x 2.54m \r\nThis bedroom has one window overlooking the front of the property, one wall-mounted light fitting and.carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nSecond Floor Stairs and Landing - 1.73m x 2.51m \r\nThe second floor landing has one window overlooking the rear of the property and carpet flooring. Solid doors lead to bedrooms four and five.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.62m x 3.11m \r\nThis dual aspect double bedroom has windows to either side of the property, one wall-mounted light fitting and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - 2.51m x 2.57m \r\nThis bedroom has one window overlooking the front of the property, one wall-mounted light fitting and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ideally suited to a cash buyer\r\nIn need of refurbishment \r\nApprox. 99.22 Sq. M / 1,068 Sq. Ft \r\nBuilt in the early 1900's\r\nBER G - No. 119693398\r\nNo heating system\r\nFive bedrooms\r\nRear courtyard\r\nExcellent location\r\nWalking distance to Cork City Centre (1.4 km)\r\nConvenient to UCC and the Mercy Hospital\r\nClose to all amenities such as schools, pharmacy and shops etc.\r\nOnly 2.5 kms from Apple HQ in Hollyhill"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G\r\nBER No. 119693398"
      },
      {
